/target

# Full official FHIR example sets, fetched on demand by `bin/fetch-examples`
# for the `#[ignore]` round-trip tests. ~190 MB each, not committed. The curated
# always-on subsets under tests/data/roundtrip_examples_<release>/ ARE committed.
/doc/fhir-specifications/*/fhir-examples-json/

# mdBook build output
/book/book/

# Fuzzing: the seed corpus under fuzz/seeds/ is committed and small; the
# working corpus libfuzzer grows from it is not — it reached 26 MB in two
# minutes. Crash artifacts are uploaded by CI on failure rather than stored
# here, so a crash arrives as a build failure with the input attached.
/fuzz/target/
/fuzz/corpus/
/fuzz/artifacts/
/fuzz/Cargo.lock
